{
  "mn76:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 76 ",
  "mn76:0.2": "Sandakasutta ",
  "mn76:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn76:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosambiyaṁ viharati ghositārāme. ",
  "mn76:2.1": "Tena kho pana samayena sandako paribbājako pilakkhaguhāyaṁ paṭivasati mahatiyā paribbājakaparisāya saddhiṁ pañcamattehi paribbājakasatehi. ",
  "mn76:3.1": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando sāyanhasamayaṁ paṭisallānā vuṭṭhito bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn76:3.2": "“āyāmāvuso, yena devakatasobbho tenupasaṅkamissāma guhādassanāyā”ti. ",
  "mn76:3.3": "“Evamāvuso”ti kho te bhikkhū āyasmato ānandassa paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn76:3.4": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando sambahulehi bhikkhūhi saddhiṁ yena devakatasobbho tenupasaṅkami. ",
  "mn76:4.1": "Tena kho pana samayena sandako paribbājako mahatiyā paribbājakaparisāya saddhiṁ nisinno hoti unnādiniyā uccāsaddamahāsaddāya anekavihitaṁ tiracchānakathaṁ kathentiyā, seyyathidaṁ—",
  "mn76:4.2": "rājakathaṁ corakathaṁ mahāmattakathaṁ senākathaṁ bhayakathaṁ yuddhakathaṁ annakathaṁ pānakathaṁ vatthakathaṁ sayanakathaṁ mālākathaṁ gandhakathaṁ ñātikathaṁ yānakathaṁ gāmakathaṁ nigamakathaṁ nagarakathaṁ janapadakathaṁ itthikathaṁ sūrakathaṁ visikhākathaṁ kumbhaṭṭhānakathaṁ pubbapetakathaṁ nānattakathaṁ lokakkhāyikaṁ samuddakkhāyikaṁ itibhavābhavakathaṁ iti vā. ",
  "mn76:4.3": "Addasā kho sandako paribbājako āyasmantaṁ ānandaṁ dūratova ā